--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,14 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Rejections for explicitly disallowed extra properties now identify the property path.
+
+- Tool input is validated against its declared schema before execution. Executors that previously handled malformed input now receive only schema-valid input; rejected calls return a message to the model.
+- Invalid static tool input schemas now fail during registration with the tool name.
+- Calls to static tools with input rejected by their schema return a validation result before the executor runs.
+
